OL,4,B'It was ruthless' - GB's Patten on     
OL,5,Bending top-ranked partnership          
OL,6,GBritain's Henry Patten agrees he was   
OL,7,G"ruthless" in splitting with his       
OL,8,Gdoubles partner and close friend Harri 
OL,9,GHeliovaara, just days after they       
OL,10,Greceived the year-end world number one 
OL,11,Gtrophy.                                
OL,13,FHeliovaara and Patten joined forces in 
OL,14,F2024 and won Wimbledon together for    
OL,15,Fthe second time in July.               
OL,17,FIn a post on his blog, the Finnish     
OL,18,Fplayer detailed the disappointment,    
OL,19,Fshock and anger he felt when Patten    
OL,20,Fphoned him with the news.              
